OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!/*%/*-'Q(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GFEATURES CBBC One announcers make the
OL,4,Ctransition from formal to friendly and
OL,5,Cconversational
OL,6,
OL,7,FIt certainly is worth noting that what
OL,8,Fmany of us would regard as the golden
OL,9,Fage of BBC Presentation was not created
OL,10,Fovernight.
OL,11,
OL,12,FAnd it's also worth celebrating how
OL,13,Fthat legacy is kept alive by announcers
OL,14,Flike Duncan Newmarch and Dean
OL,15,FLydiate.B
OL,16,
OL,23,Qppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
